# Git push / deploy

- Do **not** run `git push`, deploy, or trigger Vercel builds unless the user explicitly asks (e.g. "push", "commit and push", "deploy").
- Committing is also only when the user asks to commit.
- Prefer leaving changes local after implementation so the user can review before paying for a build.
